<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Sultan Hadlirin</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">died 1549</span> · <a href="/centuries/16th-century">16th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sultan">Sultan</a> Hadlirin was ruler of Kalinyamat near <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jepara">Jepara</a> on the north coast of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/java">Java</a> and husband of a daughter of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/trenggana">Sultan Trenggana of Demak</a>. During the Demak succession war he was murdered in 1549 by agents of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/arya-penangsang">Arya Penangsang</a>, and his widow, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ratu-kalinyamat">Ratu Kalinyamat</a>, ruled after him.</p></div>
